00:21:19,910 --> 00:21:22,670
- How's your friend? - A little better.
-你的朋友還好嗎？ -有好一點了

287
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:27,450
Do you know who's moving back into town? Tom and Sue's daughter, Jen.
你知道誰要搬回城裡了嗎？ 湯姆跟蘇的女兒，珍

288
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:32,210
You remember her, Michael. She's lovely, well-behaved and single.
你記得她的，麥克 她很可愛，行為舉止端莊，而且單身

289
00:21:32,420 --> 00:21:36,520
- I'm not interested. - Please, darling, let's be honest.
-我沒有興趣 -拜託，親愛的，我們老實說

290
00:21:36,690 --> 00:21:40,680
You can have all the sailor fun you want with that one.
你跟那個也可以享受像船員般的樂趣的

291
00:21:40,860 --> 00:21:42,920
- But let's be real. - All right, stop.
-但是我們要面對現實 -好了，停

292
00:21:43,100 --> 00:21:47,590
All Phoebe has done is try and get you to like her. Maybe it's not clear..
菲比所做的一切都是為了要讓 你們喜歡她，或許不是很明顯…

293
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:49,290
but she did her best.
但是她已經盡力而為了

294
00:21:49,470 --> 00:21:54,430
- She's a little different than you are. - Michael, a pimp spit in her mouth.
-她是跟你們有點不同 -麥克，一個壞蛋吐口水在她嘴裡

295
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:59,610
So what? If I can get past that, it shouldn't bother you.
那又如何？如果我都無所謂了 你們有什麼好在乎的

296
00:21:59,780 --> 00:22:02,980
You don't have to like her. Just accept the fact that I do.
你們沒有必要去喜歡她 只需要接受我喜歡她的事實就可以

297
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:05,620
If you can't even be civil to the woman I love..
如果你們無法對我愛的女人…

298
00:22:05,790 --> 00:22:09,690
- The woman you what? - Yeah, the woman you what?
-你什麼的女人？ -是啊，你什麼的女人？

299
00:22:11,890 --> 00:22:13,690
The woman I love.
我愛的女人

300
00:22:18,270 --> 00:22:19,600
I love you.
我愛你

301
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:26,100
Something I shouldn't say for the first time, in front of my parents..
我不該當我父母面前 第一次說這種話

302
00:22:26,270 --> 00:22:28,430
and Tom and Sue.
還有湯姆跟蘇面前

303
00:22:28,610 --> 00:22:34,240
Who are, by the way, the most sinfully boring people I've ever met in my life.
對了，他們是我一生中 遇過最無聊的人

304
00:22:36,350 --> 00:22:38,720
- I love you too. - You do?
-我也愛你 -真的？

305
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:42,310
How great is this?
很棒嗎？

306
00:22:46,130 --> 00:22:47,650
Wanna get out of here?
想要離開這裡嗎？

307
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:52,430
- Mom, Dad. Thanks for dinner. - I had a great time.
-爸媽，謝謝你們的晚餐 -我很開心

308
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:56,700
It was really top-drawer. And here's something rich.
這裡真的很高級，而且更棒的是…

309
00:22:56,870 --> 00:23:01,240
Thirteen bathrooms in this place, I threw up in the coat closet.
這裡有十三間浴室 但是我吐在衣帽間裡面

310
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,640
Ta-ta!
拜了！

311
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:26,730
One more time from the top!
從頭再來一次！

312
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:37,300
Rachel, please! That is so inappropriate!
瑞秋，拜託！ 這實在太不恰當了！

313
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


314
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

